Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:03.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲁弗斯·特纳是猎魔人 - 是你的老友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rufus Turner is a hunter. - One of your old friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 你在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good. You're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你得帮我埋个尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you got to help me bury a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是萨穆埃尔一直在做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just something Samuel's been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.31,0:00:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住它们 带到某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catching things, taking them somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.33,0:00:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,盘问信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}grilling them for info.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,盘问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说折磨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出卖了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说你到底算是个什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you supposed to be to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.33,0:00:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你我算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个你再也不想见到的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the guy you never want to see again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一次你见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next time you see me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be there to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温·坎贝尔 第三代表妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen campbell. Third cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的成长经历 跟我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They grew up in the life, like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们应该知道「炼狱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking you know "Purgatory".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了开门让什么东西进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all about opening a door to let something in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是什么 - 我还在研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给点提示吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you give us something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.61,0:00:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个名字 「万物之母」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a name."Mother of all".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:50.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.24,0:01:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吓到你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.17,0:01:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look a little …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.85,0:01:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想搭个便车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I could use a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.55,0:01:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.69,0:01:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜心 你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your name, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.24,0:01:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏娃 - 夏娃 我叫里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eve. - Eve. I'm Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去多远的地方 夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how far you going, Eve?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要多远就多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}However far you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa. Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're very pretty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你这样做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is not what's right for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.84,0:01:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎样做才是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what's right for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:51.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（耶稣爱你）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.79,0:01:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你内心的空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}This emptiness you feel inside …
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是渴望得到他的关爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really a hunger for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.71,0:01:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道其实耶稣只是个普通人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know that Jesus was just a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 但他也是上帝之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, but he was also the son of god,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝爱我们 所以派耶稣降临尘世\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent here because he loves us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝才不关心你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}God doesn't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.18,0:02:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然关心我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲创造了你 然后将你抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father made you and then abandoned you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.20,0:02:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.77,0:02:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在虚无之中看见神迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see signs where there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实是 你的天启降临然后消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}But truth is, your apocalypse came and went,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你甚至都没有注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.20,0:02:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个母亲绝不会像他一样遗弃自己的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mother would never abandon her children like he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.61,0:02:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.43,0:02:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以和你说个秘密吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I tell you a secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.19,0:03:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第16集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这周一直收到猎魔人的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been getting blasts from hunters all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼的老巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nest of vamps.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人的舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolf dance party.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.61,0:03:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个变形怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shifters, six of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.59,0:03:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个猎魔人为了消灭它们牺牲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two hunters died taking them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,食尸鬼 食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghouls, ghouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.73,0:03:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,食尸鬼幽灵自助餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghoul-wraith smorgasbord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.76,0:03:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是沿着80号洲际高速直线扫荡啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just me, or is that a straight kick-line down I-80?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.02,0:03:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.49,0:03:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去好像土豆怪兽版的远征军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to me like it's a Sherman March monster mash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但他们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but where are they marching to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.40,0:03:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人锤烂了家人的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy bashes in his family's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.98,0:03:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如我对警察说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like I told the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昏过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.58,0:04:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你还记得什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just tell us what you do remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我行驶在日常路线上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving my regular route,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.22,0:04:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在我的卡车里醒来 而且在工作的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I-I woke up in my truck at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's work?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,星光罐头厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starlight cannery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得自己怎么到那里去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't remember how I got there…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.87,0:04:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就给家里打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I called home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}When no one picked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赶回家 发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I went there, and I found…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你昏迷之前 有没有什么异常现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything unusual before you blacked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.90,0:04:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,景象 气味 任何不寻常的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sights, smells, anything off the routine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 普通的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Basic night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在卡车站 我让某个孩子搭了便车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was giving some kid from the truck stop a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.43,0:04:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I think she took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 我不是有意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear … I didn't mean to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.71,0:04:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 恶魔附身或者幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, demon possession or ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为这事和怪物有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought this was a monster thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.67,0:04:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡车站 杀人夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truck stop, night of the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.76,0:04:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,美女哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.40,0:05:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我嘞个去 这是啥玩意 - 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Freakish nightmare. What the hell was that? - Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.59,0:05:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen that in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,80号洲际公路上的那些吸血鬼和食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those vamps and ghouls out on I-80 …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是为了母亲节而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're coming in for mother's day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果她是那个妈咪大佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, if that is big mama …
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管她是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道怎样猎杀她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got zero on ganking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果遇见她 我们怎么办 期待撒盐有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we gonna do if we run into her? Throw salt and hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们夹尾巴开溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're gonna turn tail and run,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们已经无计可施了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we're in over our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我们要在碰到那骚娘们之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we better get some real info on this bitch…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到点关于她的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before we do run into her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.98,0:05:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the ruckus?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,罐头工厂有个人崩溃发狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A guy just went postal down at the cannery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 你们继续查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'll go. You finish here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦探员 威利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里边有多少 - 死了六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many in there? - Six dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 一个人走进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Apparently, a guy walks in,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.08,0:06:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出猎枪 直接就开火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}pulls a hunting rifle, just opens fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 这是探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain! This is agent …
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 城里在开联邦大会什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? There a fed convention in town or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,威利斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent willis?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没认错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是没想到你会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't expecting you…yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.57,0:06:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 你没接到我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, apparently, you didn't get the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我们失陪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, can you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.14,0:06:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里搞什么 鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the high holy are you doing here, Rufus?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你一样 追踪各种疯狂事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as you … tracking 31 flavors of crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我们都查到这儿来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which led us both smack into the middle of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.10,0:06:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能和犯人谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk to the perp?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.28,0:06:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.69,0:06:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 不知道他能不能回答我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if he's gonna talk back to us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.38,0:06:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察打中了他八枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cops put eight bullets in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么咱们一起办这案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So are we partnering on this or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 这有很难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. It's not rocket surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然都在 合作一把呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.78,0:07:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,车要我来开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long as I get to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.31,0:07:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.63,0:07:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那什么之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do you think the mother of whatever the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,专爱搞这个吗 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}is wrapped up in this, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人只是疯了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are just guys going berserk, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么可惊奇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that a monster thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 所以要把他切开看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. That's why we're hacking him open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.24,0:07:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那边的棉签给我拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand me one of those swab things over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.07,0:08:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,外胚层吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ecto?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是外胚层\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not ecto.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是新东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,新的 没什么东西是新的 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}New? No such thing as new, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正不太正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些忽然发疯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys who snapped,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的共同点就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}one thing they had in common …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在罐头厂工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They both worked at that cannery joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.46,0:08:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可能考到驾照\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know why you have a driver's license.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.65,0:08:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看俺们鲍叔把谁带来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, look what the cat dragged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你 鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It really is good to see you, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.72,0:08:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.94,0:08:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定烦死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.92,0:09:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老得自己对付这悲催货\N{\fnArial\fs30}dealing with this miserable cuss here all by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都被你看出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it that obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.39,0:09:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们仨开房去得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you three get a room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.74,0:09:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 东西带齐了不\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we all pack a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看情况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温 - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen? - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.65,0:09:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别 慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了会杀他 - 等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said I'd kill him! - Look, just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们认识对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.92,0:10:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要拥抱喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody needs a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.19,0:10:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.31,0:10:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作 你们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working. You?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.17,0:10:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你丫的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your damn business!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 带迪恩出去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, take Dean for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你搞笑呢 - 迪恩 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got to be kidding me. - Look, Dean, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么回事 - 他可能知道些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is wrong with you? - Look, maybe he knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得他做过什么 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember what he did. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.96,0:10:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没想阻止你 我叫你等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying don't. I'm saying not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你就是萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…You're Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就是扮演他们父亲的那个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be the guy pretending to be their father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有人罩着他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, somebody ought to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.14,0:11:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说闲话了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save the small talk, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿回了我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got my soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说 你屁忙都没帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No thanks to you, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.80,0:11:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该记得的我可没忘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打断这有爱的氛围\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, really hate to break up this little circle of love,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们能不能回到正题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why don't we talk shop, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如跟我们说说你在猎杀什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you tell us what it is you're hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,炼狱的一个生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A creature from purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自称夏娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She calls herself Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏娃 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eve? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们叫她母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一万年前就存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was here about 10, 000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.63,0:11:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上每一个活生生的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every freak that walks the face of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都能追溯到她那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be traced back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell do you know all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.46,0:11:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃的盐比你吃的米还多 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know half the things that I know, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到最近 你才知道我们的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, until recently, you didn't even know about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你把自己的家人丢给饥饿的食尸鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I now know that you'd throw your own kin to hungry ghouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:12:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这些就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩对他撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean lied to the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何不问问迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you ask Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.04,0:12:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.83,0:12:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是真的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨穆埃尔有没有曾试图…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Samuel really try to …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄死我吗 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,连眼都不带眨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't even blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你合伙的 就是这么个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the guy you're rolling with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那件事他一点都没说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't tell me anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.94,0:12:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我要告诉你一些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, there's something I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,先试着把伤口堵住 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can plug that hole up, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住 姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.07,0:13:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 如果你在意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry…If you care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.36,0:13:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 我当然在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you. I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩呢 - 没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Dean? - I couldn't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.57,0:13:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩肯定被附身了 跟那些人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever got into those guys must have got into Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯 帮萨穆埃尔把她挪走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus, help Samuel move her somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟萨姆把这儿锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and I will lock down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:14:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在迪恩找上我们前 先找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna want to find Dean before he finds us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要的是活口 萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna find him alive, Samuel,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.45,0:14:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我就一枪打爆你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I'm gonna put a bullet into your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你他妈把抢放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, put that damn thing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, put it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放倒你简直轻而易举 鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the least of my worries right now, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂 你们俩都冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey. Okay, both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 俩你妹 - 没心情跟你逗贫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Both of us, my ass. - I'm not in the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.93,0:15:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚有一个12英寸的疱疹从我耳朵里爬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had a 12-inch…herpe crawl out of my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 - 你听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.70,0:15:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒来 躺在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just woke up on the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.47,0:15:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚好看见这…蠕虫似的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}just in time to see this … this…worm thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的从我耳朵里出来 爬那通风口里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}sliding out of my freaking ear and into that vent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you tell me what the hell's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.93,0:15:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了格温 就这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed Gwen. That's what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:15:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是在走廊里说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just talking out in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.78,0:15:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我记得的最后一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last thing I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.26,0:16:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西肯定是上我身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing must have jumped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是说 有个怪物附在了你身上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're talking about, like, a monster that gets in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.15,0:16:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个超大的肉虫王\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a khan worm on steroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.68,0:16:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是说像寄生虫一样 有东西占领了你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean like a parasite, something that took over your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫子爬进来 又爬出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worm crawls in you, worm crawls out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物附身吗 这倒新鲜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster possession? That's novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许那东西还在你身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that thing's still in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we can't trust a word that you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.98,0:16:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查你的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check your ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.27,0:16:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫检查我耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, check my ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.04,0:16:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check my ear for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,想摸我也该先请我喝杯酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you buy me a drink first?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二次了 是粘液 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second date. Oh, yeah, we're goo positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 他什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean? What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是 那东西确实进去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means it was in you, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或者说是一直在 - 没在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or it still is. - It's not in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位都把枪交出来 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody, give up your guns. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂喂 好好想想 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, think about this for a second, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 我们都不知道究竟谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking we don't know who is and who ain't got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那可恶的肉虫王附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the damn khan worm up inside his melon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是 我们不知道在谁身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is we don't know who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be any one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.29,0:16:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们能做的 就是尽量别让那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the best we can do… Is to make it that much harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.55,0:17:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得咱们互相爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}for that thing to blow our fool heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.66,0:17:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着给你下请柬呐 坎贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you waiting for a handwritten invite, Campbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.45,0:17:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得喘口气 计划一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need some time to breathe, make a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.71,0:17:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.93,0:18:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Based on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打几个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make a few phone calls,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看有没有人听说过这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}see if anybody ever heard of anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Ditto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这边也有点门路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a few trees I can shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,扯淡呢 阿拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, balls, Allard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.73,0:18:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.23,0:18:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上个厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bathroom break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想帮我拿着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So unless you want to hold it for me…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,操 狗屁都没查到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got a dump truck full of bubkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.79,0:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是 你给威利打过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing here, either. You call Willie?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 你当我傻啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Think I'm an idjit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about Rodge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不跟我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.08,0:19:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 他也不理我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 备选计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, plan "B."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.17,0:19:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱直接把那东西揪出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just go and grab the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要么滚蛋 要么火拼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we sit on our thumbs, or we go in guns blazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟奥马哈似的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Omaha?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.22,0:19:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你妈的 说什么奥马哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you for bringing up Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.30,0:19:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,太三俗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just low.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.30,0:19:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.03,0:19:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啥 我只是很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I'm just.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.73,0:20:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你晚上睡得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}wondering how you sleep at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.33,0:20:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,像婴儿般熟睡 谢谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a baby. Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们俩献给克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fed us to Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但现在说这些也没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}True, but what am I gonna do about it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.71,0:20:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该责怪你想要杀死我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I blame you for wanting to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course not, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所做的一切都是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did was…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.51,0:20:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会道歉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢作敢当 不会纠结已经发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I did. I don't cry over spilled blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么心安理得么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you really can just go on, like…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你现在把灵魂找回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because you're Dr. Jekyll at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不代表你可以这么趾高气扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean you can get all high and mighty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了 咱俩可相处了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget, we spent a year together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们是亲人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we did. We're blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你仍然出卖了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you still sold me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 跟你比起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, what I did pales.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做的那些事就是小巫见大巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}in comparison to what you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.56,0:20:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还不止一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on more than one occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 告诉我我都干过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, tell me what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.02,0:20:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 不行 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Sam, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.19,0:20:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之所以现在还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason you're alive right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为我们还有正事要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because we're working a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我们杀掉这个怪物 你是下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The minute we kill this thing…You're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:20:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.19,0:21:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.89,0:21:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我需要把我的枪拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be needing my gun back now, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那还用说 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 别不开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.04,0:21:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这计划不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it was a good plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过一个怪物绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}except for the part where a monster would definitely,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖交出他全部的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}definitely not give up all his weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.36,0:21:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.32,0:21:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么计划 - 我们一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, what's the plan? - We stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得继续找这个怪物 被它附身的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to keep track of this thing, who it's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.04,0:22:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.88,0:22:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是饵雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Booby trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.64,0:22:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嘞个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.19,0:22:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.27,0:22:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.12,0:22:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.75,0:22:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,太贱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.50,0:22:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean? - Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.89,0:22:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在周围转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go around, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.95,0:22:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.49,0:22:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.24,0:23:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.09,0:23:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.69,0:23:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.85,0:23:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you gonna do, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.32,0:23:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会对我开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna shoot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.37,0:23:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找回了你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.57,0:23:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会对你的家人开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna shoot your own family?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.54,0:23:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我才不管家人什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I wouldn't go with the family thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.37,0:23:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽仍然是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's still my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.09,0:23:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字也是照我名字取的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still named after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.83,0:23:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 看来现在就咱俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Appears to be our moment, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.13,0:23:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想知道你的暑假是怎么过的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still want to know about your summer vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.88,0:23:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会一五一十的告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非常想知道 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dying to know, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.19,0:23:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.51,0:24:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那咱就把枪放下 好好谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, let's just put these down and talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.16,0:24:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 没事的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - It's all right, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.84,0:24:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.02,0:24:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.57,0:24:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.06,0:24:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.03,0:25:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.56,0:25:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.09,0:25:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在我们确定之前先要铐住你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to cuff you, uh, till we can be sure, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.62,0:25:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你理解的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.21,0:25:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西在他身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.73,0:25:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.69,0:25:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.91,0:25:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他倒下之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see anything come out of him…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.71,0:25:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有看到什么东西出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}after he dropped?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.80,0:25:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好是有所发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.32,0:25:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.79,0:25:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.10,0:25:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我杀他的时候 他不是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So … so you mean he wasn't a monster when I ganked him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.45,0:25:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一种方法能确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}One way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.57,0:25:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你车里有能切颅骨的锯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you got a cranial saw in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.14,0:25:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.75,0:25:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.75,0:25:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 他不是自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, he won't. He won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.98,0:25:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩一起去拿些工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will both go grab some tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.65,0:25:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看能不能接通这里的电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see about getting some power in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you and you to …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.27,0:26:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你和你看着他和他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I want you and you to watch him and him and …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有任何东西从谁的身体里爬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, if anything crawls out of anybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.80,0:26:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有人赶紧搞定它\N{\fnArial\fs30}somebody step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.96,0:26:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 不用担心 我会看着萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, don't worry. I'll watch Samuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.46,0:26:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩会看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean will watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.34,0:26:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.42,0:26:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.02,0:26:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你觉得我做的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you think I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.51,0:26:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他确实被附身 而且我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it's in him and I'm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.91,0:26:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就像在玩三赌一的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's playing three-card monte with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.41,0:26:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你还是你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm just gonna assume you're you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.33,0:26:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你能帮我把这个松开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to take this off, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.13,0:26:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要等我们把那东西从他脑子里弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till we get that sucker out of his walnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.64,0:26:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.68,0:27:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎不记得他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I barely remember him,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.11,0:27:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我记得的那些事 很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what I do remember… it's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.71,0:27:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还那样对我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what he did to us…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.12,0:27:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.65,0:27:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有「可是」\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a "But"?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.48,0:27:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不停地在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I just can't help but think…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈会怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would mom say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.45,0:27:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我认为妈会怎么说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think mom would say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.06,0:27:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会说 光有血缘关系不能算是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd say just 'cause you're blood doesn't make you family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.46,0:27:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲情是用实际行动换来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to earn that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.45,0:27:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,手术开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's play operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.88,0:27:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小子们不出去透透气 - 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You boys want to take a breather? - We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.70,0:27:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这是要给你们外公开瓢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're about to crack open your grandpa's grapefruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.56,0:27:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a breather.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.04,0:28:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么破玩意 你又去翻垃圾堆啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? Have you been dumpster-diving again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.70,0:28:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 还能用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? It still works.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.31,0:28:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.14,0:28:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.15,0:28:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯 我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Rufus, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.53,0:28:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些破事还有完没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, will wonders never cease?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.40,0:28:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你消停一会儿 我有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, s-shut up a minute. I'm trying to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.04,0:28:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥马哈那事是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault … Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.68,0:28:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的错 我当时应该听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I should … I should have listened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.11,0:28:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 听我的那是必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, that's categorical, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.66,0:28:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我 让我把话说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … l-let me just get this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.77,0:28:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 这事早说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, we've had this conversation already, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.87,0:28:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有 鲁弗斯 我一直没道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we haven't. I never said I'm sorry, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.75,0:29:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我你才失去了她 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I … you lost her because of me, and I…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.04,0:29:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我说这事不用再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I said we've had this conversation already.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.65,0:29:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是啰嗦上一天也没用 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you could blabber all day… and it wouldn't change a thing, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.77,0:29:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生那些事 我永远不会原谅你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never forgive you for what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.61,0:29:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.18,0:29:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,换个话题吧 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}So change the subject, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.39,0:30:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 你怎么样 - 鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby, you okay? - Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.16,0:30:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.04,0:30:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.10,0:30:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 我扶你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.89,0:30:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.05,0:30:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们仨都在 看来不是我的来生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can't be my afterlife 'cause the three of you are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.65,0:30:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走的时候他还在桌上挺尸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when we left, he was dead on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.57,0:30:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 后来他诈尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, till he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.75,0:31:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是怎么死了又死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how did he get double dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.96,0:31:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比把他推到开关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby threw him against that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.91,0:31:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想上面肯定通着电\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it was a live wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.82,0:31:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,电路短路 他开始抽搐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It shorted, and he went ape.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.33,0:31:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后那东西就从他耳朵里爬了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that thing crawled out of his ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.80,0:31:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们知道它的克星是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least we know what tickles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.97,0:31:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.05,0:31:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的问题是 它到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Now the question is, where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.66,0:31:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们看到了吗 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.12,0:31:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们俩有可能被附身 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You two were down for the count. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.18,0:31:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它要么是跑了 要么是在你俩谁的身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, either it bailed or it's in either one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者 在你们俩身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or…It's in one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.16,0:31:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我们俩刚才都清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we were awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.90,0:31:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们有盯着对方吗 - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you have eyes on each other? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.04,0:31:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一秒都不落吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}100% of the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.05,0:31:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样算一秒都不落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.00,0:31:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.85,0:31:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那不如我们检查有没有粘液\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, how about, uh, check for goo, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.40,0:31:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.14,0:31:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能就是跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might just be gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.44,0:32:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.11,0:32:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能是学聪明了掩盖了痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might have wised up and covered its trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.73,0:32:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那我们来百分百确认下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's settle this…100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.16,0:32:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.74,0:32:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,通电了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're live.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.77,0:32:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.74,0:32:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.02,0:32:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是医生 但我敢说他是死透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a doctor, but I'm gonna go ahead and call this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 谁先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All right, who wants to go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.56,0:32:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.82,0:32:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 别等我反…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up before I start thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.73,0:33:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,王八羔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.96,0:33:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whew. Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.63,0:33:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要帮你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, you want me to…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.77,0:33:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.77,0:33:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.19,0:33:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.73,0:33:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲不了的 鲁弗斯 别磨蹭\N{\fnArial\fs30}No passes, Rufus. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.54,0:33:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我装着心脏起搏器呢 - 祈祷它质量过关吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got a damn pacemaker. - Well, you better hope it's a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候装的起搏器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when do you got a pacemaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.71,0:33:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小布什第一届任期装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since Bush Jr., term one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.19,0:33:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们还少了三根脚趾 顺便说下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down three toes, too, F.Y.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.73,0:33:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 来吧 痛快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, come on. Just make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.46,0:33:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.75,0:33:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.86,0:33:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.54,0:33:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 我有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - No, I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.29,0:33:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.22,0:33:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.43,0:33:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.14,0:33:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没在我身上 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it ain't inside me, so go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.86,0:34:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 站着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then just stand still, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.95,0:34:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.62,0:34:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会很快的 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll make this quick. - No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.47,0:34:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了吗 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.88,0:34:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯 稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, just a second, Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.33,0:34:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等个毛 你个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second nothing, whatever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.51,0:34:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是鲍比啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.33,0:34:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍你大爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.29,0:34:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.54,0:34:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.92,0:34:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在孤军奋战 想单挑我们两个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are two of us and one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.24,0:34:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 小疱疹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, there, you little herpe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.91,0:35:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么总说疱疹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you keep talking about herpes?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.60,0:35:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.52,0:35:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.62,0:35:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.71,0:35:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 想从这里逃出去 门都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't you even think about shagging ass out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.05,0:35:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋里的所有缝隙都封住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we got every crack in this room sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.40,0:35:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.78,0:35:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.09,0:35:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆在里面很爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.06,0:35:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你们很爱他 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you love this guy, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.58,0:35:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要杀我 他也躲不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to kill me and take him with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.83,0:35:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天死掉的同伴还不够多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't you lost enough pals today?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.75,0:35:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼不得已的话也得这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do what we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.46,0:35:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有几个问题问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we got some questions for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.79,0:35:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你最好好好配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can either play ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.75,0:35:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则的话就把你烤成干儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we could fry up a little shrimp on the barbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.20,0:35:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,问吧 早等着你们问呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask. Been waiting for you to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.54,0:35:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.14,0:35:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我没什么可隐瞒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means I got nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.81,0:35:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.54,0:36:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在还不知道我是什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't got a name for me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.77,0:36:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才出现不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm new around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.56,0:36:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃把我造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eve cooked me up herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.01,0:36:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏娃这贱人到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is she, this Eve bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.49,0:36:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother of all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.54,0:36:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你们的末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the end of all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.28,0:36:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她成功以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time she's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.63,0:36:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物会比人类还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}there'll be more creatures than humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.19,0:36:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你们圈养起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll live in pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.63,0:36:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把小孩当做小牛肉做菜吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll serve up your young and call it veal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.96,0:36:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要怎么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's your deal in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.14,0:36:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制几个卡车司机有什么用么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how's jumping a few truckers gonna help?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.40,0:36:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.43,0:36:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了搞几个罐头厂工人么\N{\fnArial\fs30}to mess with a couple of cannery workers?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.09,0:36:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了引你们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We led you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.96,0:36:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.75,0:36:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她让我捎句话给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.60,0:36:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 什么话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.87,0:36:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.16,0:37:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常生气 她就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's pissed. She's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.62,0:37:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此刻开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's gonna be nothing but pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.24,0:37:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了痛苦你们将一无所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you from here on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.04,0:37:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我的回复是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's my response.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.63,0:37:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.66,0:37:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.76,0:37:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他还能坚持多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much more do you think he can take?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.45,0:37:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们杀不了我 杀了我他就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill me, not without taking him with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.72,0:37:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 我们也是迫不得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… We'll just have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但鲍比也会让我们这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}what Bobby would want us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.17,0:37:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,小鼻涕虫看你怎么出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way out now, slug-o.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.75,0:37:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, hang on in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.01,0:38:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.63,0:38:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.06,0:38:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.91,0:38:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.37,0:38:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.43,0:38:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有呼吸了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not breathing. Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.90,0:38:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没觉得鲁弗斯是教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to say, I never figured Rufus for the religious type.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.53,0:39:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不太严格遵守教规\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he didn't exactly keep kosher.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.25,0:39:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我们一起埋尸体时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He always used to pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.22,0:39:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是用老套的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the old "Can't work on the sabbath" card.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.78,0:39:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不能在安息日工作」搪塞我\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever we had to bury a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.56,0:39:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾有份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I-I was just a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.52,0:39:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾是个默默无闻的技工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was joe mechanic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.06,0:39:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有天我的妻子着魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then my wife got possessed…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.88,0:39:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,她疯了似的要杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went nuts on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.36,0:39:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刺伤了她 可是没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stabbed her, and that didn't stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.71,0:39:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 这家伙破门而入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next thing I knew, this guy comes busting in,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.47,0:39:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,用圣水洒了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}soaks her with holy water,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.81,0:39:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那恶魔直接送回了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sends that demon straight to hell so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.20,0:39:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她之后 我本来想逃得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have gone away for killing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.51,0:39:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.92,0:39:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯搞定了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus cleaned up everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.57,0:39:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,教了我一些关于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taught me a thing or two about…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.53,0:40:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间邪恶生物的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}what's really out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.29,0:40:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久 我们就一起上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon, we were riding together.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.96,0:40:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起工作了多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked like that for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.05,0:40:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像你们两兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like you two knuckleheads.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.66,0:40:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.79,0:40:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为奥马哈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Omaha.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.64,0:40:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.16,0:40:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他从没能原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he never let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.48,0:40:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该原谅你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.64,0:40:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我都做了什么 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what I did, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.59,0:40:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.59,0:40:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思 怎么就没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, it doesn't …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.39,0:40:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 到头来 你们还是亲如兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean at the end of the day, you two are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.98,0:40:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命很短暂 而我们的更短\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life's short, and ours are shorter than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.12,0:40:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命不是用来提心吊胆惴惴不安的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna spend it wringing our hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.96,0:40:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天 我们会死在什么妖魔鬼怪的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's gonna get us eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.52,0:40:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我小命要玩儿完的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when my guts get ripped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.07,0:40:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可先告诉你们 我们依然是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so you two know, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.92,0:40:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些不管是谁犯下的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blanket apology for all the crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.65,0:40:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}that anybody's done all the way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.94,0:40:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天话很多啊 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of us pulled a lot of crap, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.60,0:40:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的一笔勾销\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, clean slate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.67,0:41:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
